# air rebuild artifact - never a repo file
server/tmp/

# What a dev server writes beside itself. Both default to a path relative to
# the server's working directory (WATTROOM_TRACKS_DIR, WATTROOM_FEEDBACK_DIR),
# so running `make dev-server` without setting them drops rider audio and
# rider reports into the checkout. AGENTS.md already tells agents never to
# `git add -A`; this is the half that does not depend on anyone remembering.
server/tracks/
server/feedback/
